    "detailed_description": "Game Features:<br>\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f Diverse Motorcycle Models and Brands:<br>Choose from dozens of motorcycles ranging from classic to modern, each with unique features, mileage, and prices.<br><br>\ud83d\udcac Realistic Negotiation System:<br>Negotiate prices with customers. Evaluate their offers, make counteroffers, and secure the most profitable deals. But be careful\u2014customers won't always be easy to persuade!<br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Manage Your Own Shop:<br>Bring the motorcycles you purchase to your shop, display them, and sell them at the best prices. Optimize your showroom layout to attract more customers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/1225ed00921a893b0eaf54694153c0a5.poster.avif?t=1737398610\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/1225ed00921a893b0eaf54694153c0a5.webm?t=1737398610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/1225ed00921a893b0eaf54694153c0a5.mp4?t=1737398610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udd27 Repair and Modify:<br>Some motorcycles may need a little maintenance. Repair or modify them to increase their value and make them more appealing to buyers.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc8 Make Strategic Decisions:<br>Manage your budget wisely, find the best deals, and take the right steps to grow your business.<br><br>Not Just Buying and Selling, but a Passion!<br>Motorcycle Trading Simulator is not just about trading\u2014it allows you to explore the intricate world of motorcycles. Compare features, analyze values, and create the most attractive offerings for your shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/70a77729b4a4010ddeeabba26af46413.poster.avif?t=1737398610\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/70a77729b4a4010ddeeabba26af46413.webm?t=1737398610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361620/extras/70a77729b4a4010ddeeabba26af46413.mp4?t=1737398610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Ready to start your dream motorcycle business?<br>Bike Sales Simulator offers an unparalleled experience for motorcycle enthusiasts!",
